+   edit. EmbeddedWebView.java:699 checks document/input/current owner gates and
+   calls the existing editor.js handler. editor.js:133 applies native IME
+   selection/replacement, cancellable beforeinput, real edit/input events and
+   native editor-state publication. Independent new DOM/HTTP originals must
