+SDK, input, Parent retirement or full-feature qualification is offered.
+
+The two private afterimages add the optional cold selection and retain the
+participant before original Parent namespace callbacks. All other method
+bodies are preserved; repository defaults/files remain untouched. The exact
+Parent class is checked; no warmed Parent or late owner adoption is possible.
+
+The permanent 2,097,152-byte one-entry/directory-precount reservation exists
+before the Parent constructor namespace and initial descriptor/scandir work.
+It covers 1,242,112 bytes of worst-case serialized basename/index/scratch work
+at 512 entries. The original 3*65536-byte read window remains additive.
+Parent's pinned fixture source is 3,327 ASCII bytes: reviewed's raw/decode/UTF16
+work is below the existing window; no long-lived input/source fact is made.
+`M(R,N)=8*J(R,N)+768*N+4096` is admitted before full Parent.pins. Fresh bounded
+metadata then admits ALL actual file bytes before full-byte scans.
+
+The supported Parent remains state/disk/history/vm/fence/runtime/source.previous
+None. Typed field counts P use strict canonical_size, do not decode histories.
+A=0 follows from this exact admitted cold state; prepared/current/source stages
+are unsupported, not assigned zero cost. S is the sum of all physical Root
+files. Each real entry P claim and returned inventory claim remains additive.
+
+Before the fixture constructs/writes LifecycleProcessFile, its actual object,
+store, payload and 3*65536 physical +3*65536 transient plan are strongly held
+and charged. No resource helper creates a writer. Pending plan credit remains
+held after publication. The actual ready writer raw and full physical stamp
+must match the original Parent.pins paired-OFD/full-byte/eight-stat records.
+Unregistered files/owners, missing stages and unknown constructors refuse.
+
+Self-review found and corrected before execution: a test scene must use the
+existing controlled HTTP scene.json grammar; the actual pinned client.js is
+selected from resource-pins.v1.json, not guessed by filename; full file sizes
+must be admitted before Parent.pins, not discovered after its reads. These are
+pre-run private corrections, not test passes or old evidence relabeled.
+
+The scope reports actual original file/directory known closes separately.
+It retains files and manifests; no temporary deletion/whole-owner close claim.
+Completion assertions run outside SourceLock. Code/class/default/finalizer
+mutation and active monitoring are absent. Serialized logical accounting is
+not universal Python/native allocator or RSS proof.
+
+First-error retention is on the participant; actual file candidate/OFD and
